+  04 VERIFICATION-BASE:19-19 rule-6617447b31c170258fdc23f4b1ca0dc4b3f7c945e50c08d4e290381d3e24508f DEFINITION attrs=[]
+  05 VERIFICATION-BASE:20-20 rule-b7d6ce82ec2a2ac7221e232a8762ec40e0c5f8a33688ec923438f1197c35a783 DEFINITION attrs=[]
+  06 VERIFICATION-BASE:21-22 rule-569442f388c8214bce6f506695671575b195c7d000bcc61c81f57507abc8eeae DEFINITION attrs=[]
